{"event_type":"finding-event","id":"1a4784889d81cd79a1f9768648c2f4ace11a14d2bd6675fe3c25a4dca7fd6766","occurred_at":"2026-11-22T08:59:07Z","payload":{"action":"confirmed","actor":"crq-triage/opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash","evidence":{"anchor_verified":true,"failure_class":"evidence","mapped_intervals":[[99,102]],"mapped_path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-live-binding.py","quoted_text":"DEPENDENCY_RE = re.compile(\n    r\"(?P<directive>Wants|Requires|Requisite|BindsTo|PartOf|Conflicts|\"\n    r\"WantedBy|RequiredBy|Also|Upholds|OnFailure|OnSuccess|Triggers|\"\n    r\"TriggersBy|Unit|Service)\\s*=\\s*(?P<value>.*)\")","reason":"The dependency regex still enumerates many unit dependency directives but omits `StopPropagatedFrom` and `PropagatesStopTo`. Under systemd's unit semantics, a co-installed unit with `StopPropagatedFrom=crq-tick.service` would not be discovered by this scan, so stopping `crq-tick.service` could propagate the stop to that unit. This is a correctness defect in the existing dependency scan, not a request for a new contract requirement.","target":"133151e79ec0d026ad7a4842fd95f0dfe685e747"},"finding_id":"c7b77c93896633be5163f44f39c7843bb564e25079db60acbfaa86176229b442","previous_event_id":"ea51f1e500bedc1b08689429341e080408c3be1f6c6a663cace190f5e248deb4","review_id":"b08452801c153d71823e0063057ca8526a7754e9b9085e055e498d2c928878b1"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"finding:c7b77c93896633be5163f44f39c7843bb564e25079db60acbfaa86176229b442:1b0249cbeba084a8cad06435e13b8f4bb026e681742f48b5d5659f7ff1a443d6"}